---
// HowItWorks.astro - Linear Style
---

<section class="section how-it-works-section" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">Quickstart Workflow</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">From Fresh Server to Production in 3 Simple Steps</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        No complicated infrastructure-as-code or lengthy manual configuration.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Step Bento Grid -->
    <div class="bento-grid">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="bento-card step-bento">
        <div class="step-badge">01</div>
        <h3 class="bento-title">Run 1-Line Installer</h3>
        <p class="bento-text">
          SSH into any clean Linux server (Ubuntu/Debian) and run the installer. HivePaaS auto-initializes Docker Swarm, Traefik proxy, and SSL.
        </p>
        <div class="step-code">
          <code>curl -fsSL https://get.hivepaas.com | sh</code>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="bento-card step-bento">
        <div class="step-badge">02</div>
        <h3 class="bento-title">Connect Git or Templates</h3>
        <p class="bento-text">
          Link your GitHub/GitLab repository or pick 1-click templates for PostgreSQL, Redis, MySQL, Node.js, Go, or Python.
        </p>
        <div class="step-pills">
          <span class="linear-pill">GitHub Webhooks</span>
          <span class="linear-pill">PostgreSQL</span>
          <span class="linear-pill">Redis</span>
          <span class="linear-pill">Node.js</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="bento-card step-bento">
        <div class="step-badge">03</div>
        <h3 class="bento-title">Deploy, Preview & Scale</h3>
        <p class="bento-text">
          Your apps go live with automated SSL certificates. Test pull requests with instant ephemeral previews, and scale nodes with 1-click.
        </p>
        <div class="step-status-list">
          <div class="status-row"><span class="check-green">✓</span><span>Auto Let's Encrypt HTTPS</span></div>
          <div class="status-row"><span class="check-green">✓</span><span>Zero Downtime Rolling Update</span></div>
          <div class="status-row"><span class="check-green">✓</span><span>Multi-Node Ready</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .step-bento {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-badge {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .step-code {
    background: #040508;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--accent-amber-light);
    margin-top: auto;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .step-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .step-pills .linear-pill {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
  }

  .step-status-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: auto;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .status-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .check-green {
    color: #34d399;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
</style>
